   * 3. Covariance computation on centered data.
   *
   *    Mathematical definition (upper triangle only):
   *      cov[i][j] = sum_{k=0..N-1} data[k][i] * data[k][j],
   *      for 0 <= i <= j < M
   *
   *    Original code:
   *      for (i)
   *        for (j = i; j < M; j++) {
   *          cov[i][j] = 0;
   *          for (k)
   *            cov[i][j] += data[k][i] * data[k][j];
   *          cov[i][j] /= (float_n - 1);
   *          cov[j][i] = cov[i][j];
   *        }
