   *    Optimized structure:
   *      - Separate initialization, accumulation, scaling/symmetry.
   *      - Use k (row index) as the outermost loop so each row of
   *        data is loaded once and reused to update all cov[i][j].
   *      - Tile the (i,j) feature space so working blocks of cov
